title Expense Claims

component expense-webapp as "Expense Claims" web-application
component expense-api as "Expense API" service
component expense-db as "Expense Database" database

east expense-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server
south directory-service as "Company Directory" service
south email-service as "Email Service" service
south object-storage-service as "Receipt Storage (Amazon S3)" service

north -> expense-webapp
north -> expense-api

expense-webapp -> expense-api
expense-webapp -> expense-auth
expense-api -> expense-auth
expense-api -> expense-db
expense-api -> directory-service
expense-api -> email-service
expense-api -> object-storage-service